 "etapas": [
  {
   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "What you read, what you watch, what you think",
     "texto": [
      "The **media** are the **press**, radio, television and the internet.\n\n- **Informarse** is to look for news: **me informo por la radio**.\n- **Enterarse** is to find out something: **me enteré de la noticia por un amigo**.\n- A **fiable** source is a source you can trust.\n\nTo give your opinion about what you read or watch:\n\n- **Creo que** + indicative: **creo que es fiable**.\n- **No creo que** + subjunctive: **no creo que sea verdad**.\n- **Me molesta que** + subjunctive: **me molesta que haya tanta publicidad**."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "gramatica",
     "titulo": "Creo que and No creo que",
     "texto": [
      "When you give an opinion, the verb after **que** changes depending on what you say:\n\n- **Creo que** + indicative, when you state something: **creo que es fiable**.\n- **No creo que** + subjunctive, when you doubt: **no creo que sea verdad**.\n- **Me molesta que** + subjunctive, when you express a feeling: **me molesta que haya tanta publicidad**.\n\nThe subjunctive of **ser** is **sea, seas, sean**. The subjunctive of **haber** (hay) is **haya**."
     ],
